          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.121,
            0.884,
            0.164
          ],
          "content": "you get a palindrome. There are numbers for which you have to repeat this a large number of times."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.166,
            0.884,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": "Are there numbers for which you do not reach a palindrome at all?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.223,
            0.289,
            0.245
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Explore"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.251,
            0.832,
            0.317
          ],
          "content": "Will reversing and adding numbers repeatedly, starting with a 2-digit number, always give a palindrome? Explore and find out.\\*"
        },
        {
