        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.512,
            0.489,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": "I am a 5-digit palindrome."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.535,
            0.437,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": "I am an odd number."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.557,
            0.582,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": "My ‘t’ digit is double of my ‘u’ digit."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.579,
            0.582,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": "My ‘h’ digit is double of my ‘t’ digit."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.603,
            0.502,
            0.624
          ],
          "content": "Who am I? \\_\\_\\_\\_"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.643,
            0.681,
            0.67
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "3.6 The Magic Number of Kaprekar"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.682,
            0.726,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": "D.R. Kaprekar was a mathematics teacher in a government school in Devlali, Maharashtra. He liked playing with numbers very much and found many beautiful patterns in numbers that were previously unknown."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.796,
            0.726,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": "In 1949, he discovered a fascinating and magical phenomenon when playing with 4-digit numbers."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.741,
            0.686,
            0.881,
